            <description><![CDATA[

        <h2>ExtraDock 5.0.1-beta.4 – DockFlow Reliability! 🔗🛠️</h2>

        <h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Docks Survive a Dock Restart:</strong> When macOS relaunches its own Dock, your ExtraDock docks now repair themselves instead of disappearing — and DockFlow keeps seeing them!</li>
            <li><strong>DockFlow Show/Hide Reports Honestly:</strong> Visibility commands sent from DockFlow are confirmed against the real panel state, so a command that didn't take effect no longer reports success!</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>🚀 What's Next?</h3>
        <p>This beta continues polishing the first official V5 release — please report anything that still feels off!</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><em>Thank you for helping test ExtraDock 5! Your feedback drives every improvement we make. 💙</em></p>
            ]]></description>

